{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05只有18秒，Y却安排了多句心理叙述和两组感受词，信息切换过密，X在这一段更容易扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然整体信息更密，但【】加亮让观众能迅速抓住每段心理变化，分开的短句也更容易看清人物每一步为什么犹豫、期待、退缩或重新敞开。更重要的是，Y的感受不只是给情绪贴标签，而是把音乐的具体变化、身体感受和人物心境联系起来，水波、小船、摇荡等意象又贯穿始终，最后还能回应开头，形成完整的情感经历。X更清爽，但不少感受被压缩成概括性短词，音乐细节与心理变化之间的对应关系没有Y那么细。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dba7a08d-9be5-48cc-882e-ca8cf27b21c0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002020034043Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:21:13.639077+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e5a21657b23cf69b3cf2a558d3c1900b87e70f67146db6edd94ef727e9049c6c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web